  "_about": "Human-editable mapping for tools/art-pipeline.py. source is a character id from `inventory` (see vendor-art/INVENTORY.md). anims maps a sprite state (idle, walk, attack, death) to an animation key of that character. flip mirrors the frames so the art faces right. scale is the manifest height in tiles for a radius 0.5 unit (the renderer multiplies by r / 0.5). tint multiplies the art with a hex colour. hue rotates the art by that many degrees (use for colour variants). why is the reason for the choice.",
